{"version":"14b2401f0cb4cd1bf0969135ecea2bff","result":{"pages":1,"data":[{"SECUCODE":"603980.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603980","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"吉华集团","BOARD_CODE":"894","BOARD_NAME":"阿兹海默","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年6月14日公告显示，近日，浙江吉华集团股份有限公司(以下简称“公司”)下属控股子公司江苏康倍得药业股份有限公司(以下简称“康倍得”)同时收到国家药品监督管理局核准签发的两项利斯的明透皮贴剂《药品注册证书》。利斯的明（Rivastigmine）是一种可逆性胆碱酯酶抑制剂，其透皮贴剂剂型由诺华公司（Novartis）原研开发，于2007年首次获得美国FDA批准上市，主要用于治疗轻至中度阿尔茨海默病（Alzheimer\u0027sdisease,AD）。该产品于2017年经国家药品监督管理局（NMPA）批准中国上市，为国内阿尔茨海默病患者提供了重要的非口服给药选择。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":11,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0894","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0894","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603980.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603980","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"吉华集团","BOARD_CODE":"538","BOARD_NAME":"化学制品","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":2,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0538","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0538","BOARD_TYPE":"行业","BOARD_LEVEL":"2"},{"SECUCODE":"603980.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603980","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"吉华集团","BOARD_CODE":"535","BOARD_NAME":"QFII重仓","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":10,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0535","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0535","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603980.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603980","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"吉华集团","BOARD_CODE":"512","BOARD_NAME":"化工原料","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年半年报显示，公司染料总产能近10万吨，其中分散染料产能7.5万吨，活性染料产能2万吨以及其他染料0.5万吨，分散染料产量位居行业前三。此外公司还拥有H酸产能2万吨，硫酸产能33万吨，涂料产能6000吨，聚氨酯海绵产能6000吨，公司深耕精细化工领域多年，有效提升了产品的多样化水平。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":12,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0512","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0512","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603980.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603980","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"吉华集团","BOARD_CODE":"1749","BOARD_NAME":"2026中报预增","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"预计2026年1-6月归属于上市公司股东的净利润盈利:4,700万元,同比上年增长:1259.68%,同比上年增长4,354.33万元。","IS_PRECISE":null,"BOARD_RANK":5,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1749","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1749","BOARD_TYPE"